# Scenario 'addressbook_full': アドレスちょう with the entry saved by 'mail_inbox'. Views an entry (2nd icon), edits it (3rd icon: address
# keyboard, name intro page, name keyboard, save confirmation), adds entries with the keyboards (new entry = 1st icon; address typed
# a@b.c by cursor moves, name typed in kana), tries an address without '@', deletes one entry (4th icon, confirmation) and fills all six slots.
# Keyboard cursor: RIGHT x5 from the first key reaches 'a', DOWN x2 / RIGHT x11 reaches '@' (rows 'ABCDE abcde Z01234' / 'FGHIJ fghij z56789'
# / 'KLMNO klmno .@-_+' / 'PQRST pqrst' / 'UVWXY uvwxy'); START jumps to OK. Screen names = my reading of the screenshots.
wait 400
waitstable 60 max 600
gap 30
tap A
waitstable 60 max 600
tap A                        # title -> top menu (the first A is swallowed by the logo)
waitstable 60 max 600
tap A                        # メール
waitstable 60 max 600
tap DOWN x3
wait 30
tap A                        # アドレスちょう
waitstable 60 max 600
shot list
# --- view entry 1 (2nd icon)
tap A
wait 60
tap RIGHT
wait 40
tap A
waitstable 60 max 600
shot view
tap B
waitstable 60 max 600
# --- edit entry 1 (3rd icon): append 2 characters to the address, then to the name
tap RIGHT
wait 40
tap A
waitstable 60 max 600
shot edit_address
tap A x2
tap START
wait 40
tap A
waitstable 60 max 600
shot edit_name_intro
tap A
waitstable 60 max 600
shot edit_name
tap A x2
tap START
wait 40
tap A
waitstable 60 max 600
shot edit_confirm
tap A
waitstable 60 max 600
shot edit_done
# --- new entry (slot2)
tap DOWN
wait 40
tap A
wait 60
tap A
waitstable 60 max 600
shot slot2_intro
tap A
waitstable 60 max 600
tap RIGHT x5
tap A
tap DOWN x2
tap RIGHT x6
tap A
tap UP x2
tap LEFT x5
tap A
tap DOWN x2
tap RIGHT x4
tap A
tap UP x2
tap LEFT x3
tap A
tap START
wait 40
tap A
waitstable 60 max 600
shot slot2_after_addr
tap A
waitstable 60 max 600
tap A x2
tap START
wait 40
tap A
waitstable 60 max 600
shot slot2_confirm
tap A
waitstable 60 max 600
shot slot2_saved
# --- new entry (slot3_noat)
tap DOWN
wait 40
tap A
wait 60
tap A
waitstable 60 max 600
shot slot3_noat_intro
tap A
waitstable 60 max 600
tap RIGHT x5
tap A
tap A
tap A
tap START
wait 40
tap A
waitstable 60 max 600
shot slot3_noat_after_addr
tap A
waitstable 60 max 600
tap A x2
tap START
wait 40
tap A
waitstable 60 max 600
shot slot3_confirm
tap A
waitstable 60 max 600
shot slot3_saved
