tap DOWN
wait 40
tap A
wait 60
tap A
waitstable 60 max 600
shot slot5_intro
tap A
waitstable 60 max 600
tap RIGHT x5
tap A
tap DOWN x2
tap RIGHT x6
tap A
tap UP x2
tap LEFT x5
tap A
tap DOWN x2
tap RIGHT x4
tap A
tap UP x2
tap LEFT x3
